 Licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later. See LICENSE and NOTICE.

 The frame every automatic e-mail is sent in — the shipped ones through
 their own `content` block, a customised one through email/custom.html.twig
 (Core\Mail\Template\EmailTemplateRenderer).

 It is CODE and is never customisable, which is why the unit's name is
 never offered as an insertable variable: the greeting an administrator
 writes changes, the closing formula and the signature do not, and an
 e-mail that lost its signature because somebody deleted a line would go
 out unsigned to every family of the unit.

 That is also why the sign-off lives here rather than in each template: it
 is the one thing every message the site sends has in common, shipped or
 reworded (docs/module-development.md § E-mails).
#}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{% block title %}{{ site_name }}{% endblock %}</title>
    {#
      Typography for a body the site did not write: a CUSTOMISED e-mail is
      sanitised rich text (Core\Security\HtmlSanitizer keeps p, h2, h3,
      ul, a, blockquote and drops every style attribute), so its paragraphs
      and headings would otherwise arrive with whatever defaults the mail
      client felt like. These rules give it the same rhythm as the shipped
      templates, which carry the same values inline — an inline style wins,
      so nothing here changes a shipped e-mail.
    #}
    <style>
        .sm-content p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
        .sm-content h2 { margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.3; color: #212529; }
        .sm-content h3, .sm-content h4 { margin: 20px 0 8px; font-size: 16px; color: #212529; }
        .sm-content ul, .sm-content ol { margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 20px; }
        .sm-content li { margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .sm-content a { color: #0d6efd; }
        .sm-content blockquote { margin: 16px 0; padding: 4px 0 4px 12px; border-left: 3px solid #dee2e6; color: #4b5563; }
    </style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f4f5f7;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#333333;">
    <div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 12px;">
        <div class="sm-content" style="background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e6e8eb;border-radius:8px;padding:24px;">
            {% block content %}{% endblock %}
            <p style="margin:28px 0 0;">
                Bien à vous,<br>
                <strong>{{ site_name }}</strong>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:16px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#8a8f98;text-align:center;">
            Message envoyé automatiquement par {{ site_name }}.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
